~ start

match get_choice_count("laid_flower")
	when 0
		match get_choice_count("paid_respect")
			when 0
				PLUM: The writing is impossible to read. (sad)
				PLUM: I can only make out the words "I didn't" and "Rosie".

				- Pay respect
					$> increment_choice("paid_respect")
					You pray for Rosie.
					=> END

				- Do nothing
					=> END

			else
				if GameState.has_flower
					You've already paid your respects here.

					- Lay the flower here
						$> GameState.has_flower = false
						$> increment_choice("laid_flower")
						$> show_node("Sprite2D2")
						VINCENT: Are you done wasting time?
						PLUM: Not wasting time! (angry)
						You don't know... but you think Rosie will appreciate this.
						=> END

					- Keep the flower to yourself
						You didn't have to give the flower, but you still feel like a bad person.
						=> END

				else
					You've already paid your respects here.
					=> END

	else
		You don't know... but you think Rosie will appreciate this.
		=> END